  "problem": "The following table shows the number of babies born at a hospital in New York during a particular month:\n\n| Boys | Girls |\n| --- | --- |\n| $102$ | $81$ |\n\nApproximately $120$ girls were born at a hospital in Boston during the same month. The ratio of boys to girls was the same at both hospitals. By rounding the given data to the nearest ten, approximate the number of boys born at the Boston hospital during that month.",
